  m_text: "A normally harmless fruit that has been primed for defense. Its rapid
    barrage makes it very effective.\n\nUse: A planted watermelon will shoot a broad
    pattern of seeds at nearby enemies (Range 1.75)\n\nThe seeds will shoot out in
    a circular pattern, dealing damage on contact \n(5 damage)\n\nNutrient Cost:
    30  Refund Value: 15"
