  m_text: "A staple crop corrupted by disease. Its powerful blight should serve well
    in repelling the enemy.\n\nUse: A planted potato will produce blighted potatoes
    on nearby path tiles (Range 1)\n\nPotatoes consumed by enemies will poison them,
    inflicting damage over a set amount of time \n(5 damage for 10 seconds)\n\nNutrient
    Cost: 60  Refund Value: 30"
