  m_text: "A volatile vegetable known to explode. Its power will help in quelling
    foes.\n\nUse: A planted cornstalk will produce kernels randomly on path tiles.\n\nEnemies
    that come in contact with kernels will cause them to explode, dealing a great
    deal of damage. \n(50 damage)\n\nNutrient Cost: 80  Refund Value: 40"
