  m_text: 'A powerful offensive plant. Its strong acid dissaudes even the strongest
    beasts.


    Use: A planted lemon will fire seeking projectiles at nearby enemies
    (Range 2.5)


    Lemon projectiles will seek out enemies within the plant''s
    range and deal damage on contact.

    (10 damage)


    Nutrient Cost: 50  Refund
    Value: 25'
