  m_text: 'Hark Hallowed Defender of the Forest!


    Spread thine Roots towards
    the Verdant Orbs of Nutrients! Place your Troops near the Path of your enemies!

    Prepare
    Countermeasures against the corrupted Fauna!


    Green Button - Command your
    Roots, expanding from your current roots and the woods nearby.


    Yellow Button
    - Open the Key to view your potential Troops and Learn how to use them to your
    advantage.


    Blue Button - Designate your soldiers and roots to be refunded.
    Destroy them to regain Nutrients.


    Red Button - Finalize your Selection.
    Placing or Refunding at your leisure.


    White Button - Pause to gain time
    to ponder your strategies.

'
